Z||000018||Slammed Fiero||09-14-2001||12:23 AM||||Haven't tried the NOS. Was going to get it filld on the weekend. i was at a forum members wedding (banditBalzs- George Balzer). Credit card burnt out and got declined , then my limited cash supply ran out and I left my other bank card in my desk...<P>So hopefully this weekend. I have a 95 Firebird WS6 Lt1 that wants a go and a 00 lightning with a bad driver that wants to race.<P>My P Zero's are sticky , I have done a full banzai launches and have NO wheel hop , the clutch grabs nice and hard.<P>So we will see. I think I will beat the Bird and have a battle with the lightening. I do stress the lightning dude Can't drive. he launches it by flooring it and the tires go up in smoke.<P>Nothing commands respect like NOS. The monkey changing the oil at the Fast lube was blah blah blahing abouthis IROC , and how fast it is , he then opened the decklid and saw the bottle. I never heard about the IROC again... (hehe) <P><BR>JM <p>[This message has been edited by Slammed Fiero (edited 09-14-2001).]||||reg||1
